# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide shows how to use PEC combined with SLC to mitigate gate noise with reduced shot overhead compared to vanilla PEC.\n"
msgstr "Panduan ini menunjukkan cara memakai PEC yang dikombinasikan dengan SLC untuk memitigasi noise gate dengan shot overhead yang lebih rendah dibandingkan PEC biasa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The workflow follows:\n"
"1. Specify a circuit and observable.\n"
"2. Compute noisy, unmitigated expectation values.\n"
"3. Compute forward and backward bounds on the bias.\n"
"4. Learn the entangling layers' noise by using qiskit-noise-learning.\n"
"5. Use the learned noise to merge the computed bounds into a local scales matrix.\n"
"6. Choose the desired bias bound based on the shot overhead-bias trade-off.\n"
"7. Prepare a PEC + SLC program, execute the program, and post-process.\n"
"8. Compare the mitigated expectation values and shot overhead.\n"
msgstr ""
"Alur kerjanya sebagai berikut:\n"
"1. Tentukan circuit dan observable.\n"
"2. Hitung expectation value ber-noise tanpa mitigasi.\n"
"3. Hitung batas maju dan mundur untuk bias.\n"
"4. Pelajari noise layer entangling dengan qiskit-noise-learning.\n"
"5. Gunakan noise yang dipelajari untuk menggabungkan batas yang dihitung ke dalam matriks local scales.\n"
"6. Pilih batas bias yang diinginkan berdasarkan trade-off antara shot overhead dan bias.\n"
"7. Siapkan program PEC + SLC, jalankan program, lalu lakukan post-processing.\n"
"8. Bandingkan expectation value hasil mitigasi dan shot overhead.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify a circuit and observable {#specify-a-circuit-and-observable}"
msgstr "Tentukan circuit dan observable {#specify-a-circuit-and-observable}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare a mirror circuit of a Trotterized time evolution of a 1D Ising chain Hamiltonian on eight qubits. Mirror the circuit to cancel its unitary and form an identity circuit, so each observable's ideal expectation value is known to be 1 without the need to compute it. In addition, mirroring doubles the circuit depth, which in turn doubles the noise's effect.\n"
msgstr "Siapkan circuit cermin dari evolusi waktu Trotterized sebuah Hamiltonian rantai Ising 1D pada delapan qubit. Cerminkan circuit untuk meniadakan unitary-nya dan membentuk circuit identitas, sehingga expectation value ideal setiap observable diketahui bernilai 1 tanpa perlu menghitungnya. Selain itu, pencerminan menggandakan kedalaman circuit, yang pada gilirannya menggandakan efek noise.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the angle $\\theta= \\frac{\\pi}{4}$ to make the dynamics non-Clifford.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan sudut $\\theta= \\frac{\\pi}{4}$ agar dinamikanya non-Clifford.\n"

