# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose desired bias bound based on shot overhead-bias trade-off {#choose-desired-bias-bound-based-on-shot-overhead-bias-trade-off}"
msgstr "Pilih batas bias yang diinginkan berdasarkan trade-off antara shot overhead dan bias {#choose-desired-bias-bound-based-on-shot-overhead-bias-trade-off}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this guide we choose a bias tolerance of 5%. Note that this bias calculation is based on the learned noise model, which might not be perfectly aligned with the real noise of the device.\n"
msgstr "Dalam panduan ini kita memilih toleransi bias sebesar 5%. Perhatikan bahwa perhitungan bias ini didasarkan pada model noise yang dipelajari, yang mungkin tidak sepenuhnya selaras dengan noise nyata dari device.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare a PEC + SLC program, execute the program, and post-process {#prepare-a-pec--slc-program-execute-the-program-and-post-process}"
msgstr "Siapkan program PEC + SLC, jalankan program, lalu lakukan post-processing {#prepare-a-pec--slc-program-execute-the-program-and-post-process}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With the local scales chosen, we can build the full PEC+SLC execution program. The `PEC.prepare` call constructs a `QuantumProgram` that encodes the anti-noise injection strategy into the circuit's box annotations. Passing `noise_gain=\"slc_local_scales\"` instructs the executor to use the per-error weights set by `set_slc_local_scales`, rather than applying the same full inverse-noise gain to every error as vanilla PEC would.\n"
msgstr "Dengan local scales yang sudah dipilih, kita bisa membangun program eksekusi PEC+SLC lengkap. Pemanggilan `PEC.prepare` membangun `QuantumProgram` yang mengodekan strategi injeksi anti-noise ke dalam anotasi box circuit. Memberikan `noise_gain=\"slc_local_scales\"` menginstruksikan executor untuk memakai bobot per error yang ditetapkan oleh `set_slc_local_scales`, alih-alih menerapkan gain inverse-noise penuh yang sama pada setiap error seperti yang dilakukan PEC biasa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To produce a fair comparison, a second `PEC` task is prepared with `noise_gain=0`, which corresponds to full PEC cancellation with no SLC bias allowance. Both programs are added to the same `QuantumProgram` so they share a single execution job — their circuits are interleaved and executed together, meaning any hardware drift affects both equally.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menghasilkan perbandingan yang adil, task `PEC` kedua disiapkan dengan `noise_gain=0`, yang berkaitan dengan pembatalan PEC penuh tanpa kelonggaran bias SLC. Kedua program ditambahkan ke `QuantumProgram` yang sama sehingga berbagi satu job eksekusi — circuit-nya disisipkan berselang-seling dan dijalankan bersama, artinya drift hardware memengaruhi keduanya secara setara.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After the job completes, `postprocess` converts the raw measurement bitstrings into expectation values, applying the appropriate PEC rescaling factor γ for each task.\n"
msgstr "Setelah job selesai, `postprocess` mengonversi bitstring pengukuran mentah menjadi expectation value, dengan menerapkan faktor penskalaan ulang PEC γ yang sesuai untuk setiap task.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare the mitigated expectation values and shot overhead {#compare-the-mitigated-expectation-values-and-shot-overhead}"
msgstr "Bandingkan expectation value hasil mitigasi dan shot overhead {#compare-the-mitigated-expectation-values-and-shot-overhead}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The ideal expectation value of the mirrored circuit is 1 by construction, so the bias of any estimate is simply `|1 - result|`. This final cell prints the bias and total shot count for three scenarios side-by-side:\n"
msgstr "Expectation value ideal dari circuit cermin adalah 1 secara konstruksi, sehingga bias dari estimasi apa pun cukup `|1 - result|`. Sel terakhir ini mencetak bias dan jumlah total shot untuk tiga skenario secara berdampingan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Unmitigated**: the raw noisy expectation value with no error cancellation applied.\n"
msgstr "**Tanpa mitigasi**: expectation value ber-noise mentah tanpa pembatalan error.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Full PEC**: zero-bias error cancellation using the complete inverse noise model on every layer, at the full γ² sampling overhead.\n"
msgstr "**PEC penuh**: pembatalan error tanpa bias dengan model inverse-noise lengkap pada setiap layer, pada sampling overhead γ² penuh.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**PEC+SLC**: error cancellation guided by the shaded-lightcone local scales, tolerating the chosen `bias_tolerance` in exchange for a substantially lower shot count.\n"
msgstr "**PEC+SLC**: pembatalan error yang dipandu oleh local scales shaded-lightcone, menoleransi `bias_tolerance` yang dipilih sebagai ganti jumlah shot yang jauh lebih rendah.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Comparing the three rows shows the concrete benefit of SLC: the mitigated bias of PEC+SLC stays well below the unmitigated bias while the total number of shots is significantly smaller than what full PEC required.\n"
msgstr "Membandingkan ketiga baris menunjukkan manfaat konkret SLC: bias hasil mitigasi PEC+SLC tetap jauh di bawah bias tanpa mitigasi sementara total jumlah shot jauh lebih kecil daripada yang dibutuhkan PEC penuh.\n"
